 <italic>jejuni</italic> NCTC 11168 (<uri xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/genomes/lproks.cgi">http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/genomes/lproks.cgi</uri>);d: calculated cell numbers using the standard formula (SF; 5,11).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Crossing Point Values Using Species Specific and Universal Primers</p></caption><table frame="border" rules="all" width="100%"><thead><tr><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Species</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">DNA (ng)</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Species Specific Primer</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Universal Primer 1</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Universal Primer 2</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Universal Primer 3</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>A. actinomycetemcomitans </italic></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">15.6</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12.62</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10.76</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12.19</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>P. gingivalis</italic></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">13.5</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14.06</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">11.27</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20.46</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>T. denticola</italic></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14.05</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">13.82</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">18.75</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">28.94</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>T. forsythia</italic></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td><td align="center